# Decode
# - ESR 0x96000035: EC=0x25 (data abort, current EL), DFSC=0x35 (synchronous
#   EXTERNAL abort — bus error, not a translation fault).
# - FAR 0xffff80000807fec0 (kernel linear map, DRAM ~128MB), x0 same.
#   x1=8, x2=0x20 (32?), x3=0x50 — small ints, looks like a memutils op.
# - DAIF unmasked (spsr 0x600003c5). Board halted (EL1 HALT loop).
# - NOTE: stress itself passed; fault came after, at/after the prompt.
#   Possibly the same class as the cycle-4 post-prompt fault (which had no
#   readable dump). Different signature from the slab wild-pointer fault.
